<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") -%>

<div class="container mt-4 mb-5" style="max-width: 800px;">
  <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p class="text-muted">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-IN", { year: "numeric", month: "long", day: "numeric" }) %></p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h5>
  <p>When you create an account or list a property on WanderLust, we collect information such as your name, email address, and listing details (location, price, photos) that you choose to provide.</p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
  <p>We use the information you provide to create and manage your account, display your listings to other users, process reviews, and improve our services.</p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">3. Data Storage</h5>
  <p>Listing images are stored securely via Cloudinary. Account credentials are encrypted and never stored in plain text.</p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">4. Cookies</h5>
  <p>We use session cookies to keep you logged in and to remember your preferences while browsing the site.</p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">5. Third-Party Services</h5>
  <p>We use Geoapify for location geocoding and Cloudinary for image hosting. These services may process data you submit as part of using WanderLust.</p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">6. Your Rights</h5>
  <p>You may update or delete your listings at any time. To request account deletion, please contact us.</p>

  <h5 class="mt-4">7. Contact</h5>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to our support email.</p>
</div>